OL,3,ALithuania ready to 'fight back' but has
OL,4,Aevacuation plans in face of Russia
OL,5,Athreats, PM tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FLithuania's prime minister has told the
OL,8,FBBC his country has made evacuation
OL,9,Fplans in the face of threats from
OL,10,FRussia, but added they "will not
OL,11,Fsurrender" if attacked.
OL,13,FPrime Minister Mindaugas SinkeviDMius
OL,14,Ftold Newsnight that Lithuanians feel
OL,15,F"constantly threatened" by Russia, in
OL,16,Fpart because of drones entering the
OL,17,Fnation's airspace.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
